      "name": "comment",
      "x": 58.9,
      "y": 26.1,
      "text": "You can use the ASCII keyboard in a musical performance.\n\nTo Do:\n* Click in the background of the root window to focus on that window.\n* Press some keys on the keyboard. Notice when the on and off events are sent.\n* Press the Z key and hear the low drum.\n* Press the X key and hear the high drum.\n* Double click on the header for the keyMatch with the X.\n* Change the matching key to B. Click in the main window to close the editor.\n* Press the B key.",
